OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry over the weekend although a few
OL,7,Fshowers possible across Argyll. Rain
OL,8,Flikely to spread northeast on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
